      <data key="d13">Substance-P receptor; This is a receptor for the tachykinin neuropeptide substance P. It is probably associated with G proteins that activate a phosphatidylinositol-calcium second messenger system. The rank order of affinity of this receptor to tachykinins is: substance P &gt; substance K &gt; neuromedin-K; Belongs to the G-protein coupled receptor 1 family.</data>
