      <data key="d13">Glutathione S-transferase omega-2; Exhibits glutathione-dependent thiol transferase activity. Has high dehydroascorbate reductase activity and may contribute to the recycling of ascorbic acid. Participates in the biotransformation of inorganic arsenic and reduces monomethylarsonic acid (MMA). Belongs to the GST superfamily. Omega family.</data>
