      <data key="d13">Reactive oxygen species modulator 1; Induces production of reactive oxygen species (ROS) which are necessary for cell proliferation. May play a role in inducing oxidative DNA damage and replicative senescence. May play a role in the coordination of mitochondrial morphology and cell proliferation; Belongs to the MGR2 family.</data>
